    "title": "MAD-WEB",
    "date": "2024-04-06",
    "description": "<!--gravity:desc=html-->\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  <strong style=\"color: #60a5fa;\">Gather 'round, fellow coders and tech enthusiasts!</strong> Prepare yourselves for the ultimate coding showdown at the <strong style=\"color: #60a5fa;\">MadWeb Hackathon</strong>!\n</p>\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  Mark your calendars from <strong style=\"color: #818cf8;\">April 6th to April 8th, 2024</strong>, for an exhilarating <strong>36-hour marathon</strong> of non-stop innovation and coding prowess. Hurry up as we'll unravel a theme that'll set your creativity ablaze and propel your skills to unprecedented heights.\n</p>\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  With prizes worth a staggering <strong style=\"color: #a5b4fc;\">40k+</strong> up for grabs, you wouldn't want to miss out!\n</p>\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  Register before <strong style=\"color: #818cf8;\">April 6th, 2024, at 12 noon</strong>, to secure your spot in this monumental event.\n</p>\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSceKtxfk-7TCYwPkEcKZ8w3z0-z68X9IqFF8yc6Xa1chYj1TA/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: underline;\">Registration link</a> (LINK EXPIRED)\n</p>\n<p style=\"color: #e5e7eb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">\n  <strong style=\"color: #60a5fa;\">#MadWebHackathon #CodeToCreate</strong><br>\n  <strong style=\"color: #60a5fa;\">#Aparoksha #codetovictory</strong>\n</p>",
